.TH CVFSD 8 "June 2014" "Xsan File System"
.SH NAME
cvfsd \- Xsan File System Daemon 
.SH SYNOPSIS
.na
.nh
.HP
.B "Internal Kernel Thread"
.ad
.hy
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBCvfsd\fR is a server daemon that is launched by the
\fIXsan File System\fR
.BR mount_acfs (8)
command. It is an internal kernel
thread and is used for network communication to the \fIFile System 
Manager\fR. Multiple \fBcvfsd\fR threads are launched for each 
Xsan volume. The number of 
\fBcvfsd\fR threads can be modified. See
.BR mount_acfs (8)
for details.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cvfs (8),
.BR mount_acfs (8)
